### States

| State | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| `IDLE` | No active session; awaiting session start |
| `SCANNING` | Active scanning; accepting barcode input |
| `PAUSED` | Session paused; scans ignored until resumed |
| `COMPLETE` | All lines scanned or operator marked complete; awaiting reconciliation |
| `RECONCILED` | Discrepancies resolved; inventory adjustments applied |

