| From | To | Trigger |
|------|-----|---------|
| `IDLE` | `SCANNING` | `startSession(transferId, mode)` called |
| `SCANNING` | `PAUSED` | `pauseSession()` called or app backgrounded |
| `SCANNING` | `COMPLETE` | `completeSession()` called OR all lines matched (if `autoCompleteOnAllLinesMatched`) |
| `PAUSED` | `SCANNING` | `resumeSession()` called |
